bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    stage2_if_val_text_option_transport_tls_end_2026-11-04, 0, "2026-11-04 ROOT-FIXED+STAGE2-GATED (commit dc662dde275). Frozen Stage 2 binary can bind the Option box rather than the unwrapped text payload for 'if val x = dict.get(k)', causing result_err_layout_identity to interpolate garbage text (s4e e0011 _tls_end AV at frame result_err_layout_identity+0x2c). Workaround at src/compiler/50.mir/_MirLoweringExpr/expr_dispatch.spl:1590 unwraps self.array_element_struct_syms.get(base_local.id) ?? '' into a bare text before checking != ''. Current MIR lowering passes wa_src_lane5_workaround_audit_spec.spl; guard remains until frozen Stage 2 seed is rebuilt. Evidence: doc/08_tracking/bug/stage2_if_val_text_option_transport_tls_end_2026-11-04.md."

